    "extract": "Cody Canada and The Departed is an American rock band. The band was formed in 2011 by Cody Canada, the former lead vocalist and guitarist for Cross Canadian Ragweed after that band broke up in 2010. The band currently consists of Canada, Jeremy Plato, Peyton Glasco, and Eric Hansen (drums).",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Cody Canada and The Departed</b> is an American rock band. The band was formed in 2011 by Cody Canada, the former lead vocalist and guitarist for Cross Canadian Ragweed after that band broke up in 2010. The band currently consists of Canada, Jeremy Plato, Peyton Glasco, and Eric Hansen (drums).</p>"
